{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>警方元朗警區特別職務隊聯同入境處昨日（11日）在區內於展開代號「火石」（FLINTSTONE）行動，打擊非法賣淫活動。共拘捕21名內地女子，年齡介乎18至73歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕女子現正被扣留調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.031094+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:20:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.185914+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:23.951174+00:00","content_hash":"54e9ed6141ba72f4f4b412ab94a7c7becd99af2153cad43f36f43b0cb122218f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.031094+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}